WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.227
The RCMP's dereliction of duty.

00:00:02.227 --> 00:00:06.295
Ninety-eight thousand Canadian citizens dead under a state-sanctioned program.

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:10.352
Three consecutive RCMP Commissioners since 2016.

00:00:10.352 --> 00:00:12.159
Zero investigations.

00:00:12.159 --> 00:00:13.840
Zero interventions.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.398
Zero accountability.

00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:16.397
The numbers.

00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:20.090
2016: one thousand and eighteen deaths.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:24.443
2017: two thousand, eight hundred and thirty-eight.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:28.068
2018: four thousand, four hundred and eighty.

00:00:28.068 --> 00:00:32.147
2019: five thousand, six hundred and thirty-one.

00:00:32.147 --> 00:00:35.988
2020: seven thousand, five hundred and ninety-five.

00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:37.749
Each year the number climbs.

00:00:37.749 --> 00:00:40.022
Each year the RCMP does nothing.

00:00:40.022 --> 00:00:49.772
Aktion T4 — the Nazi program to eliminate disabled people — killed between seventy thousand and one hundred thousand people between 1939 and 1941.

00:00:49.772 --> 00:00:54.863
Canada's MAID program has now reached ninety-eight thousand deaths since 2016.

00:00:54.863 --> 00:00:58.840
We have matched the lower bound of a program that was prosecuted at Nuremberg.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.045
Commissioner liability is established under Criminal Code Section 504.

00:01:03.045 --> 00:01:07.681
Any person — any Canadian — can lay an information before a Justice of the Peace.

00:01:07.681 --> 00:01:09.590
No lawyer is required.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:11.090
The mechanism exists.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:13.499
The question is whether Canadians will use it.

00:01:13.499 --> 00:01:18.761
Bill C-14 received Royal Assent on June 17th, 2016.

00:01:18.761 --> 00:01:23.295
The original safeguard — reasonably foreseeable death — was supposed to prevent this.

00:01:23.295 --> 00:01:27.284
Bill C-7 removed that safeguard in 2021.

00:01:27.284 --> 00:01:28.818
The RCMP watched.

00:01:28.818 --> 00:01:30.931
The RCMP did nothing.

00:01:30.931 --> 00:01:32.909
The RCMP is complicit.
